## THE BRIEFING: SOREN ASH, TOWER APPRAISER

**Soren Ash** is the Tower's assigned Appraiser for this floor — a neutral party with no investment in who wins. He operates from a small booth adjacent to the central fountain and is available any time the market is open.

**Soren:** *"You are Floor 8 participants. Each of you has a stall assigned by quadrant. I will explain the rules once."*

> **Rule 1.** Your stalls are empty. Nothing can be sold until you have goods. Use whatever means are available to you to procure items.
>
> **Rule 2.** Various activities are available throughout the town. Each takes time. Skill will be required for most.
>
> **Rule 3.** At the end of each day, a Selling Phase occurs. Customers arrive. Whoever has the highest amount of GP after five days wins.
>
> **Rule 4.** During the Selling Phase, your stall must have at least one person assigned to it. That person is responsible for everything on display.
>
> **Rule 5.** Acts of violence within the bazaar boundary are forbidden and will be penalized accordingly.
>
> **Rule 6.** Any tactic that does not involve violence within the bazaar is permitted.
>
> **Rule 7.** You are each given one cart with a twenty-slot capacity. Manage it accordingly. Expansion is possible at cost.
>
> **Rule 8.** Outside the bazaar boundary, you may not access your cart. You may carry up to five items on your person when leaving the bazaar.
>
> **Rule 9.** Bring any item to me and I will identify its base market value. I will not tell you what to charge for it. That is your problem.

*[He produces a quill.]*

