## ROBBING A HOUSE (Major Action — Residential Lanes)

Targets a house by size. Reward is **guaranteed** at the size's tier — no randomness on quality, only on whether you're caught. Category is set by the house's flavor (a smith's home yields Mine goods, a hunter's lodge yields Hunt goods — DM assigns, or roll 1d4 if undetermined). Houses are one-time targets; the town is large enough that there's always another, so the limiting factor is Alertness, not a finite supply. No Huge-tier houses exist — that ceiling belongs to Gathering alone.

| House Size | Rounds | Check | Base DC | Reward | Alertness (success) | Alertness (caught) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Small | 4 | Stealth or Sleight of Hand | 12 | 1 Small-tier item | +1 | +2 |
| Medium | 7 | Stealth or Sleight of Hand | 14 | 1 Medium-tier item | +2 | +4 |
| Large | 10 | Stealth or Sleight of Hand | 16 | 1 Large-tier item | +3 | +6 |

### Alertness (party-wide, Residential Lanes only — scale 0–9+)

| Alertness | State | Effect |
|---|---|---|
| 0–1 | Quiet | No DC change |
| 2–3 | Noticed | +2 to robbery DC |
| 4–5 | Watching | +4 to robbery DC |
| 6+ | Hunted | Residential Lanes locked to robbery for the rest of the day. Attempting anyway skips the check entirely — you're caught automatically. |

Alertness decays **−2 every morning**, floor 0.

### Getting Caught

On a failed check: lose the rounds, gain no item, Alertness rises by the "caught" amount, and roll 1d4:

| d4 | Consequence |
|---|---|
| 1 | **Guard Chase** — Stealth or Athletics contest, DC 10 + current Alertness tier's DC bonus, to escape. Failure: stall confiscated 1 day + Reputation −3. |
| 2 | **On-the-spot fine** — lose gold equal to 2× the house tier's base value. Reputation −1. |
| 3 | **Marked** — Reputation −2; for the rest of today, any further robbery Alertness gain is doubled. |
| 4 | **Iron Ledger notices** — Syndicate Pressure +1. No immediate personal consequence, but it's logged. |

**Case the House** (Round Action, see Round Actions table) lets a player learn a target's category in advance before committing the Major Action.

